3|0@electronic_cigarette^1439607499#cu3jngr:hometownzero$:Mostly from Adirondack Vapor which I consider premium. About 90% of my juice is from them. I always take advantage of sales or discounts and buy as high a volume of juice as possible. This usually nets me a price of $0.40/ml or under which is what I shoot for. Bulk orders can be as low as $0.26/ml. I'm also very fortunate to have been gifted and/or won some juice as well. But even at full cost to me I feel it's a reasonable price to maintain. There is almost always a discount code to be utilized especially from Reddit favorite vendors. Major holidays are the best times to stock up but usually sales can be had every weekend. 
